OL,3,CProgramme listings for SUN 19 APR
OL,4,G0600FAfrodeutsche
OL,5,     GSundays are for staying under the
OL,6,     Gcovers a little longer. Let
OL,7,     GAFRODEUTSCHE provide the perfect
OL,8,     Gfor your Vinyl Weekender.
OL,9,G0800FRadcliffe and Maconie
OL,10,     GStuart Maconie presents a feast
OL,11,     Gof great music and chat for
OL,12,     Gweekend breakfast, and plays some
OL,13,     Gof his favourite album tracks as
OL,14,     Gpart of 6 Music's Vinyl Weekender.
OL,15,G1000FCerys Matthews
OL,16,     GCerys hosts your Sunday sonic and
OL,17,     Gcultural adventure on the 6 Music
OL,18,     GVinyl Weekender, with Brazilian
OL,19,     Glegend Marcos Valle and Robin
OL,20,     GScott a.k.a 'M' on working with
OL,21,     GVivienne Westwood.
OL,23,Vppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
